From: Nick Kennedy <nick@nick-kennedy.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:56:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] kosmickrisp: add KK_CUSTOM_RESOLVE_DEBUG experiment
 switches

Local diagnostic only. KK_CUSTOM_RESOLVE_DEBUG=log prints the first
custom resolve render states; magenta clears the resolve target before
the application's resolve draws; average replaces the application's
resolve result with a meta AVERAGE resolve when the pass ends.

AI-written commit text (biblioklept).

